    "NSHumanReadableCopyright": {
      "comment": "Copyright line shown in the About window. Keyed on the Info.plist key, so the English value MUST be spelled out here — without it the window would render the key name. Translate only the word 'Copyright' and the rights sentence; the year and the name stay as they are.",
